{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-60","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：二项无理线段与平方与比例","englishTitle":"The square on the binomial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the first binomial.","book":10,"number":60,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.60","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.60/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":60,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","contentId":"euclid-10-60","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4bb517ef4aaf01af462deb4074bebdff66ac7d0a202950a6d2b05ee154bb1df2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-60.statement","euclid-10-60.construction.1","euclid-10-60.construction.2","euclid-10-60.construction.3","euclid-10-60.proof.1","euclid-10-60.proof.2","euclid-10-60.proof.3","euclid-10-60.proof.4","euclid-10-60.proof.5","euclid-10-60.proof.6","euclid-10-60.proof.7","euclid-10-60.proof.8","euclid-10-60.proof.9","euclid-10-60.proof.10","euclid-10-60.proof.11","euclid-10-60.proof.12","euclid-10-60.proof.13","euclid-10-60.proof.14","euclid-10-60.proof.15","euclid-10-60.proof.16","euclid-10-60.conclusion","euclid-10-60.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-60.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11f76ec9aea9ec0324dbdce6137ee4481879c0be173d133c5b3a5b53c6eef8a3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on the binomial straight line applied to a rational straight line produces as breadth the first binomial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"二项无理线段直线上的正方形直线适用于有理线段直线,作为第二项无理线段宽度产生。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"740863b9f1bbf8c211396751e4ed14d85846f35cfed4cf010c658ce676c3ff89","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a binomial straight line divided into its terms at C, so that AC is the greater term; let a rational straight line DE be set out, and let DEFG equal to the square on AB be applied to DE producing DG as its breadth; I say that DG is a first binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB线成为二项无理线段直线,分为C,因此AC是较大的期限;让有理线段 DE线列出,AB线的DEFG线适用于DE,宽度为DG;我说,DG线是第一个二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8b1655a41b97703902d4e49d6b58fa2ca310c6b260a2e52ee7f8e44e90a4f1b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let there be applied to DE the rectangle DH equal to the square on AC, and KL equal to the square on BC; therefore the remainder, twice the rectangle AC, CB, is equal to MF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DE,矩形,DH等于正方形,AC,KL等于正方形,BC,BC,DE;因此,其余的两倍于矩形,AC,CB,等于MF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ad0d8394262119d0d4aa8bbb5bedc40ed31455cc743dd0e731a772fd88b6de0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let MG be bisected at N, and let NO be drawn parallel [to ML or GF]."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让MG在N线上两分开,让NO线平行[ML或GF]。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4d2020ff64669125ca19766247ab97f0c006152bca033cb8cf3305c54cab176","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the rectangles MO, NF is equal to once the rectangle AC, CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 MO,NF中,每号中的每一件都等于矩形 AC,CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52e83ff9a3ac34a97e1fb51c4e17eed9464a434a3193a53616ee18a1062cb157","citations":["euclid-10-36","euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB is a binomial divided into its terms at C, therefore AC, CB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)] therefore the squares on AC, CB are rational and commensurable with one another, so that the sum of the squares on AC, CB is also rational. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB是二项无理线段,分为C,因此AC,CB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,AC,CB是正方形,CB是有理,可公度是彼此的,因此,AC,CB的正方形和有理也是有理。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)] [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e0252790e051ae387f33f7db7306e1c98bb862cb176b8a075aa9abce75e12c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is equal to DL; therefore DL is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"等于DL,因此DL是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de0a09ed11d26875d8b1869099aa909c68433269fb64c0ddc6713e6dcb6dc0d8","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line DE; therefore DM is rational and commensurable in length with DE. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 DE;因此,DM为有理和长度可公度为DE。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23b6cd33877c0c40476de7ad0ff62e497e99e1d535139976499444923e2fb3b8","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AC, CB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, therefore twice the rectangle AC, CB, that is MF, is medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,CB为有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,是矩形 AC,CB,即MF,的两倍；这里涉及中项无理量。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"916c85f5c2c6710db3523f050c647ee13c980b701de0ba3d28de0ecbc3d4f51e","citations":["euclid-10-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is applied to the rational straight line ML; therefore MG is also rational and incommensurable in length with ML, that is, DE. [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 ML;因此,MG也为有理和不可公度,ML,即DE。 [[X. 22](/principles/euclid-10-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58891fa44f18d87b18c422938dda29d19b7eae63fd92acc03fe12bdc25935869","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MD is also rational and is commensurable in length with DE; therefore DM is incommensurable in length with MG. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MD也是有理,长度可公度DE,因此DM长不可公度,MG。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f93458f7d0d708f2d2873b31ca376d00babe0149412168669d4ac52f879027c","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And they are rational; therefore DM, MG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore DG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"它们是有理,DM,MG,有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度,DG,二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"218a6af0de6be8c4a96e7ed8179f2b84f8dae437908479a4d8de3bad2b29399e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is next to be proved that it is also a first binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"下一步是证明这也是第一个二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"718194bb0d6421240e5feabe2d6d8680a683f60070bbbe28e9194e7564728cb5","citations":["euclid-10-53"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since the rectangle AC, CB is a mean proportional between the squares on AC, CB, [cf. [Lemma after X. 53](/principles/euclid-10-53)] therefore MO is also a mean proportional between DH, KL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于矩形 AC,CB是AC,CB之间的比例中项,CB也是AC,CB,CB也是比例中项,DH,KL。（相关点与线段：MO） [cf. [引理 after X. 53](/principles/euclid-10-53)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"daea1c2f61c921aa5360626e14fb83c6ff58c9ae7b9bdd0fc2c44023a4508de2","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as DH is to MO, so is MO to KL, that is, as DK is to MN, so is MN to MK; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DH对MO的比等于KL,即DK对MN的比等于MN对MK的比;因此,矩形对DK对KM等于MN对正方形的比；DH 与 MO 之比等于 MO 与 KL 之比；DK 与 MN 之比等于 MN 与 MK 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"606da6dcab9e56d99e8a4f7e34d7103cf649bc7f0c0dd5ffa5832cf4afbd3bc4","citations":["euclid-6-1","euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on AC is commensurable with the square on CB, DH is also commensurable with KL, so that DK is also commensurable with KM. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1), [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC正方形可公度正方形CBCBDH可公度KLKLDK可公度KM [ [VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1) [X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"230f34c4c429de784dfd77707bdf706823e0529400c86794b4b304aa0eef1dec","citations":["euclid-10-59","euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the squares on AC, CB are greater than twice the rectangle AC, CB, [[Lemma](/principles/euclid-10-59)] therefore DL is also greater than MF, so that DM is also greater than MG. [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC正方形CB 超过矩形ACCBCB2倍 所以DLMFMFDMMGMG [[引理](/principles/euclid-10-59)] [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d4570592ff6be0fa19333d2f15726e01fb923c784a77434be1779ed81388aad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the rectangle DK, KM is equal to the square on MN, that is, to the fourth part of the square on MG, and DK is commensurable with KM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"矩形 DK KM等于MN的正方形,即正方形的第四部分MG,DK等于可公度和KM。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"346dd7f4836ee6dde55a4bcda9dd13b214739a9a09a30c13e0a7026e54f586ac","citations":["euclid-10-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if there be two unequal straight lines, and to the greater there be applied a parallelogram equal to the fourth part of the square on the less and deficient by a square figure, and if it divide it into commensurable parts, the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater; [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)] therefore the square on DM is greater than the square on MG by the square on a straight line commensurable with DM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果有两条不均的直线,如果数量较大,则对数量较小的正方形适用相当于其第四部分的平行四边形,并有正方形个数字的不足,如果将数量较大的部分分为可公度个,则数量较大的正方形,比数量较小的正方形的正方形,再增加可公度直线的正方形,再增加数量;因此,DM对DM对正方形对MG对正方形对正方形对DM直线的可公度对可公度对可公度对正方形对正方形对DM对正方形对可公度对正方形对正方形对可公度对正方形对可公度对正方形 [[X. 17](/principles/euclid-10-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"891aa033d52c04dbcc024b1d7fc5c4c5efc8f8320fa94a213148b220302f7e45","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DM, MG are rational, and DM, which is the greater term, is commensurable in length with the rational straight line DE set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DM,MG是有理,DM是数量较大的期限,长度可公度,有理线段,DE是数量较大的期限。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":20,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"524a1a8978b8f9a467f1eb4616800e10d8b98ba1c8d44f798be2f7766027ef49","citations":["euclid-10-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DG is a first binomial straight line. [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DG是第一个二项无理线段直线,证毕。 [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-60.source","contentId":"euclid-10-60","revisionId":"euclid-10-60@raw-4bb517ef4aaf01af","order":21,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"548a061ef174ea101c7ee4fb93595ac53333484b3f6a1072051041c1ce210c36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.60/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.60\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"